    modified_response: "I will compile the Bento grid features panel (`src/components/BentoFeatures.tsx`). It details Toss\'s staple services through customized micro-interactive panels:\n1. **\355\206\240\354\212\244\355\216\230\354\235\264 (Toss Pay)**: Renders an active virtual credit card that elevates itself and shifts angles upon hovering.\n2. **\354\225\210\354\213\254\353\263\264\354\203\201\354\240\234 (Security Audit)**: Features a real security audit scanning component that simulates scanning the browser context for SSL and port anomalies to declare \"\354\225\210\354\240\204 (Prime Level)\" in 3 seconds.\n3. **\355\206\240\354\212\244\354\246\235\352\266\214 (Toss Securities)**: Represents a live mock stock ticker chart drawing beautifully synchronized waves on an SVG element.\n4. **\353\263\264\355\227\230\352\270\210 \352\260\204\355\216\270 \354\262\255\352\265\254 (Insurance Claims)**: Solicits receipt uploads or selector nodes, triggering an OCR text scanner simulation to auto-populate claim fields and trigger a submit transaction."
